{"id":"177489951e58f69f","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md","title":"ZFC Poset Bounded Lattice","display":"df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice — ZFC Poset Bounded Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice — ZFC Poset Bounded Lattice","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice — ZFC Poset Bounded Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\leq,0,1\\in V\">\\(L,\\leq,0,1\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(L,\\leq,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq)\\land0\\in L\\land1\\in L\\land\n\\forall x\\in L\\;(\\langle0,x\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle x,1\\rangle\\in\\leq)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(L,\\leq,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq)\\land0\\in L\\land1\\in L\\land\n\\forall x\\in L\\;(\\langle0,x\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle x,1\\rangle\\in\\leq)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The least- and greatest-element clauses use the lattice order as the declared set of ordered pairs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-poset-lattice.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\leq,0,1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S(L,\\leq,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,\\leq)\\land0\\in L\\land1\\in L\\land\n\\forall x\\in L\\;(\\langle0,x\\rangle\\in\\leq\\land\\langle x,1\\rangle\\in\\leq)","display":true}],"bytes":925,"backlinks":[{"id":"44ab18b3631aa4ec","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S$ (bounded-lattice predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice]])"},{"id":"39f739a0ae971bf5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetBoundedLattice}_S$ (bounded-lattice predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice.md|58-df-zfc-poset-bounded-lattice]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["79109424a5779d49"]}